{"id": "upright_sprinkler", "name": "Upright sprinkler", "description": "Glass bulb sprinkler that stands on top of exposed range pipework and throws water up against its deflector, used where there is no ceiling (plant rooms, car parks, warehouses). Defaults: 15 mm (1/2 in) thread, K80, 68 C bulb, about 57 mm tall, deflector 100 mm below the soffit. Typical values; spacing and deflector distance come from the design standard (BS EN 12845 or NFPA 13).", "tags": ["upright sprinkler", "sprinkler", "fire sprinkler", "exposed pipework", "suppression", "fire"], "ifc_class": "IfcFireSuppressionTerminal", "predefined_type": "SPRINKLER", "params": {"thread": [0.015, 0.015, 0.02, "m", "nominal thread size, 15 or 20 mm"], "drop": [0.1, 0.025, 0.45, "m", "deflector below the soffit"]}, "geometry": [{"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, 0], "material": "brass", "radius": "0.0105 * thread / 0.015", "height": "0.014 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "extrude", "at": [0, 0, "0.014 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "brass", "profile": {"ngon": 6, "radius": "0.015 * thread / 0.015"}, "height": "0.008 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "sweep", "material": "brass", "profile": {"circle": "0.0028 * thread / 0.015"}, "path": [["-0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.022 * thread / 0.015"], ["-0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.04 * thread / 0.015"], [0, 0, "0.05 * thread / 0.015"]]}, {"shape": "sweep", "material": "brass", "profile": {"circle": "0.0028 * thread / 0.015"}, "path": [["0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.022 * thread / 0.015"], ["0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.04 * thread / 0.015"], [0, 0, "0.05 * thread / 0.015"]]}, {"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, "0.022 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "bulb", "radius": "0.0025 * thread / 0.015", "height": "0.024 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, "0.046 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "brass", "radius": "0.005 * thread / 0.015", "height": "0.006 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "cone", "at": [0, 0, "0.052 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "brass", "