{"id": "sidewall_sprinkler", "name": "Horizontal sidewall sprinkler", "description": "Glass bulb sprinkler fixed through a wall near the ceiling, throwing water out across the room; used in hotel rooms, corridors and flats where pipework cannot run in the ceiling. Defaults: 15 mm (1/2 in) thread, K80, 68 C bulb, projecting about 60 mm from the wall, deflector 150 mm below the ceiling (100 to 150 mm is usual). Typical values.", "tags": ["sidewall sprinkler", "wall sprinkler", "sprinkler", "fire sprinkler", "suppression", "fire"], "ifc_class": "IfcFireSuppressionTerminal", "predefined_type": "SPRINKLER", "params": {"thread": [0.015, 0.015, 0.02, "m", "nominal thread size, 15 or 20 mm"], "drop": [0.15, 0.1, 0.3, "m", "deflector axis below the ceiling"]}, "geometry": [{"shape": "group", "rotate": [-90, 0, 0], "children": [{"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, 0], "material": "chrome", "radius": "0.03 * thread / 0.015", "height": 0.003}, {"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, 0.003], "material": "brass", "radius": "0.0105 * thread / 0.015", "height": "0.018 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "extrude", "at": [0, 0, "0.018 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "brass", "profile": {"ngon": 6, "radius": "0.015 * thread / 0.015"}, "height": "0.008 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "sweep", "material": "brass", "profile": {"circle": "0.0028 * thread / 0.015"}, "path": [["-0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.026 * thread / 0.015"], ["-0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.044 * thread / 0.015"], [0, 0, "0.054 * thread / 0.015"]]}, {"shape": "sweep", "material": "brass", "profile": {"circle": "0.0028 * thread / 0.015"}, "path": [["0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.026 * thread / 0.015"], ["0.013 * thread / 0.015", 0, "0.044 * thread / 0.015"], [0, 0, "0.054 * thread / 0.015"]]}, {"shape": "cylinder", "at": [0, 0, "0.026 * thread / 0.015"], "material": "bulb", "radius": "0.0025 * thread / 0.015", "height": "0.024 * thread / 0.015"}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["-0.018 * thread / 0.015", "-0.014 * thread / 0.015", "0.05